708
00:58:34,120 --> 00:58:36,918
الَّذِي يُؤْتِي مَالَهُ يَتَزَكَّىٰ۝

709
00:58:37,080 --> 00:58:39,674
وَمَا لِأَحَدٍ عِندَهُ مِن نِّعْمَةٍ تُجْزَىٰ۝

710
00:58:39,924 --> 00:58:43,109
إِلَّا ابْتِغَاءَ وَجْهِ رَبِّهِ الْأَعْلَىٰ۝وَلَسَوْفَ يَرْضَىٰ۝

711
00:58:44,099 --> 00:58:48,140
It says that the one, who will be spared from the fire is the one, who is Atqaa(أتقى)

712
00:58:48,199 --> 00:58:50,546
one of the name of Abu Bakr(ابوبكر) is Atqaa(أتقى), the most pious one.

713
00:58:51,371 --> 00:58:55,657
The one, who gives for the sake of Allah, seeking no payback in Duniyah(دنيا).

714
00:58:55,935 --> 00:58:58,259
He is doing it for Allah, he is not doing it,

715
00:58:58,521 --> 00:59:01,362
so that he will have some strong men, who would stand for him.

716
00:59:01,763 --> 00:59:03,220
He's doing it to please Allah.

717
00:59:03,520 --> 00:59:05,700
And then the last Ayaah(آية) in the Surah(سورة) says,

718
00:59:06,005 --> 00:59:06,883
وَلَسَوْفَ يَرْضَىٰ

719
00:59:07,161 --> 00:59:12,147
Allah will please him, Allah will make Abu Bakr(ابوبكر) happy, it's a promise from Allahعَزّوجَلّ.

